### Normalized scores (1–100)

- **Tool use: 78/100.** Evidence AA Coding Agent ~70; capped by missing Claw-Eval/Tau3 isolation.
- **Reasoning: 78/100.** Evidence GPQA ~78% lineage; capped by incomplete HLE/MRCR.
- **Context window: 96/100.** 1,050,000 / 128K out — tiered per methodology (≥1M=95-100, 200K=70, 256K≈72).
- **Multimodal: 55/100.** Text, image in; text out; scored per multimodal rubric (text-only 15, image 60-70, video/PDF 75-90, audio-in 90-100).
- **Coding: 80/100.** Evidence LiveCode ~80% Luna ; DeepSWE ~55%; capped by missing isolated LiveCode/SciCode where noted.
- **Cost efficiency: 90/100.** Paid $0.20/$1.20 per 1M (Luna efficient).
- **Overall Score: 77/100.** Mean of five non-cost dims (78+78+96+55+80)/5=77.4 → 77; best-fit per scoring methodology.

